ABILITY:FEAT|TYPE:NORMAL|CATEGORY:FEAT|KEY:Absorb Spirit|TYPE:General|DESC:You absorb restless spirits into your body at the cost of your own life force and sanity.|DESC:Wisdom damage.&pipe;!PREABILITY&colon;1,CATEGORY=Internal,Rules ~ Use Sanity|DESC:sanity damage equal to 1/2 the spirit's CR (minimum 1).&pipe;PREABILITY&colon;1,CATEGORY=Internal,Rules ~ Use Sanity|DESC:If you succeed, you take 1 point of Constitution and|DESC:Wisdom damage.&pipe;!PREABILITY&colon;1,CATEGORY=Internal,Rules ~ Use Sanity|DESC:sanity damage equal to 1/4 the spirit's CR&pipe;PREABILITY&colon;1,CATEGORY=Internal,Rules ~ Use Sanity|DESC:No effect can prevent or reduce this damage, nor can the damage be healed or suppressed by any means until you release the spirit. You can release the spirit at any time as a standard action, at which point the spirit returns to its former location and begins rejuvenating or manifesting again as normal. If you die from the Constitution damage, the spirit is|DESC:released, and if you become comatose from the Wisdom damage, the spirit gains control of your body (and can release itself whenever it desires).&pipe;!PREABILITY&colon;1,CATEGORY=Internal,Rules ~ Use Sanity|DESC:released.&pipe;PREABILITY&colon;1,CATEGORY=Internal,Rules ~ Use Sanity
